{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07685","headline":"将适天台留别临安李主簿 · 孟浩然","name":"将适天台留别临安李主簿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枳棘君尚栖，匏瓜吾岂系。\n念离当夏首，漂泊指炎裔。\n江海非堕游，田园失归计。\n定山既早发，渔浦亦宵济。\n泛泛随波澜，行行任舻枻。\n故林日已远，羣木坐成翳。\n羽人在丹丘，吾亦从此逝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}